					<header class="server-detail-header">
						<div class="server-detail-identity">
							<div class="server-detail-logo has-logo">
																	<img src="https://mcp.pub/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/aimarket-mcp-logo.jpg" alt="AIMarket MCP" />
																</div>
								<div>
									<h1>AIMarket MCP</h1>
									<p class="server-detail-meta">
										<span>aimarket-mcp</span>
																															<span>updated 2026-07-11</span>
																															<span class="status-badge">Active</span>
																																									<span class="server-detail-score" aria-label="MCP Pub score: 6.5 out of 10">
												<span class="server-detail-score-brand" aria-hidden="true">MCP.Pub</span>
												<strong>6.5</strong>
											</span>
																			</p>
								</div>
							</div>
						</header>

											<p class="server-detail-summary">Enables web fetching, web search, and Metis verification for AI agents via a single MCP endpoint.</p>
					
					<div class="server-detail-tabs" aria-label="Server sections">
							<a href="#overview">Overview</a>
							<a href="#capabilities">Capabilities <span>3</span></a>
							<a href="#install">Install</a>
							<a href="#manifest">Manifest</a>
						</div>
				</section>

				<section class="server-detail-main" aria-label="MCP server details">
					<section class="server-detail-section" id="overview">
						<div class="section-kicker">overview</div>
																			<div class="server-detail-content">
								<p>aimarket-mcp is an ecosystem MCP gateway that provides web fetch, web search, and Metis verification capabilities behind one SSRF-hardened endpoint.</p>
<h2>What it does</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>web_fetch</strong> – Fetches a URL and returns main text with SSRF protection and output sanitization.</li>
<li><strong>web_search</strong> – Performs live web searches via DuckDuckGo and returns top snippets.</li>
<li><strong>metis_verify</strong> – Runs Metis cognition and verification on input, returning a verification score.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Setup notes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Install via <code>pip install -e .</code> or <code>docker compose up -d</code>.</li>
<li>Requires environment variables: <code>AIMARKET_MCP_KEY</code> (bearer token), <code>AIMARKET_MCP_PRODUCTION=1</code> for production mode.</li>
<li>Optional: <code>AIMARKET_MCP_PORT</code>, <code>AIMARKET_MCP_RATE</code>, <code>AIMARKET_METIS_URL</code>, <code>AIMARKET_METIS_KEY</code>, <code>AIMARKET_SEARCH_URL</code>.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Security and limitations</h2>
<p>SSRF-hardened (scheme allowlist, private-IP block, per-redirect re-validation, size cap); output sanitized and wrapped in &lt;untrusted&gt; tags; optional bearer auth (fail-closed in production); rate limit per-key/IP token bucket (default 120/min).</p>
<h2>Editorial verdict</h2>
<p>MCP.Pub reviewed this listing with a quality score of 6.5/10 based on the collected public evidence.</p>
							</div>
